{"$": "MessagePosted", "thread": "case-demo", "msg": "case-reply", "role": "assistant", "text": "The case assembly is on the **Mech** tab, exploded so you can see the board inside:\n\n- Two printable parts: a bottom tray and a vented lid, split at the top of the PCB.\n- Front openings for UART USB-C, microSD, RJ45, USB-C PD and the barrel jack.\n- Flexure buttons for POWER and BOOT, with light pipes above the four LEDs.\n- Board mounting standoffs and 16 mm of headroom for a low CM5 heatsink.", "at": 1793548813}
